# Architecture

## Framework

Modus Web Components 2.0 — Stencil JS component library with Tailwind CSS and DaisyUI theming.

## Key Commands

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `npm start` | Stencil watch + Storybook (port 6006) + lint |
| `npm run build` | Full production build (Stencil + Storybook + CEM) |
| `npm run build:ci` | Stencil library build only |
| `npm test` | Jest unit tests (`stencil test --spec`) |
| `npm run lint` | ESLint + Prettier + Stylelint |
| `npm run tailwind:build` | Compile Tailwind/DaisyUI CSS |
| `npm run embed:css` | Embed global CSS into components |
| `npm run embed:component-css` | Embed per-component CSS |

## Structure

```
src/
├── components/          # One directory per component (tsx, scss, spec, stories)
├── styles/              # Global CSS, themes, mixins, Tailwind config
├── utils/               # Shared utilities
└── custom-elements.json # CEM manifest
integrations/            # React, Angular, Vue, Blazor, MAUI wrappers
.storybook/              # Storybook configuration
```

## Theming

Six DaisyUI themes: `modus-classic-light/dark`, `modus-modern-light/dark`, `connect-light/dark`.
Design tokens live in `src/styles/themes/` and `src/styles/modus-wc-variables.css`.

## Testing

100% Jest coverage threshold. Snapshot tests per component. Storybook for visual docs.
